The GOT in Xcode 27.0's ld order (B-193, docs/formats/build.md "Objective-C references, archive members and hints in
the linked image"): by the slots' ordinals read as unsigned, the image's own symbols first, then each dylib's in
load order, the weak definitions (bound or rebased), the flat lookups; by name within each. lld kept the order of
first reference. The slots' fixups are recorded once the order is known.
